  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Give that:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Convert the numerator and denominator in the form of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>s</mi><mi>in</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
